Lightweight NATS-based worker that runs whisper-cli for the Pherb
speech processing orchestrator. Subscribes to transcription requests
via NATS, converts audio to WAV via ffmpeg if needed, executes
whisper-cli, and replies with the JSON transcript.

Built with Zig using kqueue-based I/O for zero-CPU idle wait.
Runs on the host alongside whisper-cli and audio models.
